      "code_analysis": "The purpose of the `prepare_interface_table` C/C++ function is to create a reference array (called 'intfTable') that contains references to all instance methods in an object's virtual table for each class it inherits from, along with those classes themselves. The input parameter is a pointer to a korp_class object.",
