      "code_analysis": "This C/C++ function is a recursive search for a field within an object hierarchy. It traverses the class tree of a given class (korp_class), searching for any fields that match the provided string names and descriptions, returning them on its way up or down through the classes. If it encounters a non-class interface, it searches among those as well.",
